    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than three years from the date of this decision.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: A-002, A-010, A-015, A-016, A-020, A-022, A-025, A-026, A-028, RGL-23-3913-01, Unnumbered Location Plan Received 03 July 2023",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building, unless otherwise shown on the approved plans.",
    "Condition : 4 - Before the development hereby permitted is first occupied or brought into use, the existing vehicular access to the north of the proposed extension shall be permanently closed and kerbs reinstated so that it cannot be used as an access across the pavement.",
    "Condition : 5 - Within one planting season of the removal of the tree, the five replacement trees shall be replanted across the school grounds. The trees shall be of 'Standard' size i.e. with a single stem with clear trunk at least 1.8 metres and a girth of not less than 8-10 centimetres at a point one metre above ground level at the time of planting and shall be maintained in perpetuity. Should a replacement tree die or become seriously damaged or moribund, then a further replacement tree to the same specification shall be planted immediately."
